# ADR-001: Standardize on REST APIs

**Status:** Accepted

## Context

Atlas currently exposes several different API styles across services.
This has increased client complexity and documentation effort.

## Decision

All newly developed services will expose REST APIs following the Northstar API standards.

Existing services will migrate over time as part of normal development.

## Consequences

### Positive

- Consistent developer experience
- Simpler documentation
- Easier testing

### Negative

- Existing services will require gradual migration.
- Multiple API styles will temporarily coexist.
